t static hub 158, so it is not an artifact of hub-mediated connectivity. The path is single and thin, so the cascade is genuine but fragile.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 29943, "total_output_tokens": 3281, "total_tokens": 33224, "total_latency_ms": 44261, "llm_calls": 5, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}